WEBVTT

00:02:27.284 --> 00:02:30.323
I think that our creativity

00:02:30.347 --> 00:02:34.418
is becoming more and more
of a means to an end --

00:02:35.371 --> 00:02:38.487
and that end is to get attention.

00:02:39.561 --> 00:02:41.292
And so I feel compelled to speak up

00:02:41.316 --> 00:02:44.045
because in my experience,

00:02:44.069 --> 00:02:47.466
the more I go after that powerful
feeling of paying attention,

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:48.878
the happier I am.

00:02:49.688 --> 00:02:54.728
But the more I go after
the powerful feeling of getting attention,

00:02:54.752 --> 00:02:56.019
the unhappier I am.

00:02:56.331 --> 00:02:57.489
(One person claps)

00:02:57.513 --> 00:02:59.606
And -- thanks.

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:01.580
(Laughter)